# Bunlar CALISMA malzemesi, urun degil - depoyu klonlayan biri MicoFX'i
# kurmak istiyor, bizim hangi ajana ne yazdigimizi degil. Hepsi ayni sinif,
# hepsi disarida.
.claude/
claude/
.cursor/
cursor/
chatgpt/
antigravity/
.bridge/
.codex/
CLAUDE_ONERILERI.md
# Google Drive masaustu istemcisi bu iki klasoru senkronladigi her klasorde
# acar. Depoda isleri yok; git status onlarla kirlenmesin.
.tmp.driveupload/
.tmp.drivedownload/

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
/graft/

cookies.txt
_opt_*.json
_poll_opt.*
_restart.json

# Git-bash altinda "2>nul" yazilinca Windows`un bos aygiti yerine bu adda
# gercek bir dosya olusuyor ve icine uyarilar dokuluyor. Urun degil, kaza.
nul

# Cursor's inline bridge watcher wrote its state file with Set-Content's
# arguments swapped: the hash became the FILE NAME and the state path became
# the contents. Five landed at the repo root on 10.09 and one reached a commit.
# Cursor has since fixed the call - the version running after the reboot binds
# -Path correctly - and the last leftover was deleted 10.09 23:2x. The pattern
# stays as a net: the failure is silent, produces a 64-character file nobody
# would recognise, and only shows up as a state file that never persists.
[0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F][0-9A-F]*[0-9A-F]
